PDD's business model: e-commerce, Costco + Disney
Moat: differentiated competition versus Taobao, JD, and Douyin; a distinctive shopping experience; scale effects (the larger the consumer-side traffic, the higher merchants' switching cost); extreme efficiency; agricultural supply chain
Corporate culture: highly focused
